     "\r<br>On Sat, Feb 11, 2017 at 2:35 PM, ArjunaCap &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mcaw...@greenstenergy.com</a>&gt; wrote:\r<br>&gt; ...not that I&#39;m saying that the problem is with httr, only that I can&#39;t\r<br>&gt; figure out another fail point.\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; I have an R script running on a linux virtual machine, executed as a\r<br>&gt; background process (ie $&gt; Rscript ./my_script.R ).\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; The script relies on the httr package to frequently contact a remote device\r<br>&gt; over http for some xml, which is then appended to a long running csv file\r<br>&gt; local to the VM.\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; Nevertheless, my script frequently fails- typically within 48 hours, and I&#39;m\r<br>&gt; having a hard time diagnosing why.\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; Here is my best MRE with potential fail points, though of course the real\r<br>&gt; script is longer.  Any help or pointers are greatly appreciated:\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; l\r<br>&gt; library(httr)\r<br>&gt; library(xml2)\r<br>&gt; library(tidyverse)\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; i = 1\r<br>&gt; readr::write_csv(data_frame(value = character()), &quot;my_df.csv&quot;) #dummy csv\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;  while (i &lt; 10000) {  #10k minutes is about 7 days\r<br>&gt;    try( response &lt;- httr::RETRY(&quot;GET&quot;,&quot;<a href=\"https://httpbin.org/xml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://httpbin.org/xml&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792357133219000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1laEJwZBtdL4mR3TmwGMp9\">https://httpbin.org/xml</a>&quot;, times =\r<br>&gt; 100, pause_base = 10, pause_cap = 3600))\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;    try(\r<br>&gt;      if (http_error(response) == FALSE) {\r<br>&gt;        x &lt;- content(response, &quot;parsed&quot;, encoding = &quot;UTF-8&quot;)\r<br>&gt;      }\r<br>&gt;    )\r<br>&gt;    try(x &lt;- x %&gt;% xml_find_first(&quot;.//em&quot;) %&gt;% xml_contents() %&gt;%\r<br>&gt; as.character() %&gt;% as_data_frame())\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;    try(readr::write_csv(x, &quot;my_df.csv&quot;, append = TRUE))\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;    i &lt;- i + 1\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;    Sys.sleep(60)\r<br>&gt;  }\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>"
