     "<div dir=\"auto\"><div>I don&#39;t know. There is still a live pid associated with the script, and there isn&#39;t an interesting error msg, even when I run it locally and watch the terminal. </div><div><br></div><div>I simply notice that no new data is getting appended to the csv. <br><br><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0)\">-- <br><br>Michael Cawthon<br>Chief Investment Officer<br>Green Street Energy LLC<br><a dir=\"ltr\" href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mcaw...@greenstenergy.com</a><br>p: <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"tel:479-442-1407\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">479-442-1407</a></span></div></div>"
